s\n- Fixed state modifier mismatch (isOpen → is-open)\n- Restored toggle/reveal animations in control, faq, and expansion components\n\n* Closes MIL-254: done\n\n* Closes MIL-247: refactor(blue-cards): set props to required.\n\n* refactor(blue-card): fix button to be logic-based.\n\n* Closes MIL-246: refactor(stencl): fix potential drift in supportEmail and supportEmailLink.\n\n* navbar refactor\n\n* navbar refactor\n\n* closes MIL-245: refactor(stencil): added store handler ref, added memory leak prevention, added custom event for popstate\n\n* fixes MIL-238: fix(index): add SSR safety and improve error handling in index.tsx\n\n* part of MIL-241: fix(types): resolves TS errors for asset imports and cleans up stale interfaces\n\n* closes MIL-255: refactor(api): removes graphql / data fetching from stencil components and creates a thin service layer in react for optimizations (caching, deduplication, memoization)\n\n* part of MIL-248: fix: link cards spacing on overview and resources page\n\n* fixes MIL-243: fix(FAQ): keyboard accessibility & header issues\n\n* fixes MIL-252: refactor: dedupes queries in Expansion Card and adds ID + keys\n\n* fixes MIL-253: fix(UI): Link card padding/spacing\n\n* refactor: stencil components and React layer to be more DRY\n\n* refactor(stencil): consume client-fed controls connection json in control-card\n\n* part of MIL-241: fix(typing): align control and expansion custom element props in frontend-types\n\n* part of MIL-241: fix(client): align stencil JSX prop typings with current component APIs\n\n* fix(stencil): improve control card semantics and lazy icon loading and make control card fully prop-driven from react controls data\n\n* part of MIL-241: chore(client): remove stale custom-element fetch-first prop typings\n\n* part of MIL-254: refactor(stencil): normalize toggle/reveal class patterns across cards\n\n* fixes MIL-240: fix(stencil): improve control card semantics and lazy icon loading and make control card fully prop-drive