istic key builders for controls and faqs queries in keys.ts\n- export singleton cache instance via index.ts, driven by CACHE_MAX_ITEMS env var\n- add RedisAdapter stub for future swap-in without interface changes\n)\n\n* feat(cache): implement swappable LRU/Redis abstraction with deterministic key builders\n\n* fix(graphQL): updates reseolvers from backend-optimization merge\n\n* closes MIL-272: feat(cache): add prefix invalidation strategy and mutation stubs\n\n- add optional invalidatePrefix to Cache interface for adapter flexibility\n- implement invalidatePrefix in LruCacheAdapter using keys() iterator\n- add invalidation.ts with named helpers invalidateControls + invalidateFaqs\n- add mutations.ts stub showing write → invalidate → return pattern for admin mutations\n\n* added  fixed invalidate prefix and changed some comments\n\n* part of MIL-269: fix(server): correct SQL for ILIKE escape clause in shared pagination search helper\n\n* fixes MIL-269: refactor(server): add request-scoped promise memoization to read services\n\n* fixes MIL-271: refactor(cache): add normalized read-cache key builders for shared service caching\n\n* part of MIL-229: Removed jest from stencil\n\n* part of MIL-229: Uninstalled jest\n\n* part of MIL-229: removed jest config and testing folder\n\n* Part of MIL-229: Just implemented a unit test for the control card\n\n* Merge branch ''backend-optimization'' into mila\n\n* chore: stubs testing files\n\n* chore: rename testing folder\n\n* chore: remove legacy testing stubs\n\n* chore(testing): rename and move testing folders + files\n\n* chore(testing): consolidate test layout and remove legacy stencil jest artifacts\n\n* chore: updates playwright run\n\n* chore(testing): clean up testing\n\n* part of MIL-229: chore(testing): adds unit testing for pagination and graphql integration testing\n\n* chore: linting to merge\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Annie Tadvick <annie.tadvick@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Xavier <xglover410@gmail.com>\nCo-a