flict\n\n* fixes merge conflict in pdf files\n\n* Add crlf/lf check to CI file\n\n* husky test\n\n* remove deprecated husky wrapper\n\n* format test\n\n* remove format test code\n\n* finish husky/prettier setup\n\n* fix: remove leftover merge conflict message\n\n* fix(husky): format entire repo\n\n* implemented testing for stencil with jest/control card component && implemented vitest for backend\n\n* chore: add Oleg todos\n\n* Part of MIL-254: refactor(stencil control cards): remove redundant attribute config from stencil props. change css classes to kebab case.\n\n* Part of MIL-254: refactor(stencil faq-card): remove redundant attribute config from stencil props. change css classes to kebab case.\n\n* Part of MIL-254: fix(stencil control-card): change span classes to kebab case.\n\n* Part of MIL-254: refactor(stencil expansion cards): remove redundant attribute config from stencil props. change css classes to kebab case.\n\n* Part of MIL-254: fix(stencil): align kebab-case class names with CSS selectors to restore expandable behavior\n\n- Standardized camelCase → kebab-case class names\n- Updated TSX class bindings for expandable primitives\n- Fixed state modifier mismatch (isOpen → is-open)\n- Restored toggle/reveal animations in control, faq, and expansion components\n\n* Closes MIL-254: done\n\n* Closes MIL-247: refactor(blue-cards): set props to required.\n\n* refactor(blue-card): fix button to be logic-based.\n\n* Closes MIL-246: refactor(stencl): fix potential drift in supportEmail and supportEmailLink.\n\n* navbar refactor\n\n* navbar refactor\n\n* closes MIL-245: refactor(stencil): added store handler ref, added memory leak prevention, added custom event for popstate\n\n* fixes MIL-238: fix(index): add SSR safety and improve error handling in index.tsx\n\n* part of MIL-241: fix(types): resolves TS errors for asset imports and cleans up stale interfaces\n\n* closes MIL-255: refactor(api): removes graphql / data fetching from stencil components and creates a