o not be on top of the person icon\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Annie Tadvick <annie.tadvick@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Amen Stoney <112218549+tehutiboy20@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Elijah Morris <morrisxelijah@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: milapaprika <mila.henson@protonmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Xavier <xglover410@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Amen Stoney <amenstoney@gmail.comgit config --global user.name Amen>\nCo-authored-by: Amen Stoney <amenstoney@gmail.com>\n\n* fix(server): wire missing mutationResolvers import to unblock integration tests\n\nReferenced at resolvers.ts:530 but never imported from mutations.ts,\ncausing a ReferenceError that prevented all integration tests from booting.\n\nAll 24 tests now pass across unit, integration, and fallback suites.\nDB verification complete: cleanapply, seed (x2), and explain all pass.\n\nCloses MIL-312\n\n* test(server): make taxonomy integration resilient to db auth fallback\n\n* part of MIL-295: refactor: extract taxonomy helpers + batch seed upserts and dedupe frontend contracts through shared types\n\n* fixes MIL-317: refactor(server): centralize search normalization and overview validation rules and test shared search contract edge cases\n\n* fixes MIL-318: feat(server): adds overview search graphql query\n\n* fixes MIL-319: feat(server): add overview search service built from existing read paths\n\n* closes MIL-320: refactor(server): centralize search semantics and grouped overview composition\n\n* fixes MIL-296: fix(server): align search services with shared memo and fallback contracts\n\n* fix(client): add react jsx typing for aon-theme-toggle\n\n* feat(server): add grouped overview search graphql contract (#73)\n\n* Closes MIL-179: final styling and component spacing for blue card complete\n\n* Change border colors and text spacing to closely align with mockup.\n\n* Closes MIL-180: final styling and spacing for the title section.\n\n* part of MIL-192: Figuring out how State works in Stencil,