ove control card semantics and lazy icon loading and make control card fully prop-driven from react controls data\n\n* part of MIL-241: chore(client): remove stale custom-element fetch-first prop typings\n\n* part of MIL-254: refactor(stencil): normalize toggle/reveal class patterns across cards\n\n* part of MIL-251 and MIL-249: refactor(stencil): make navbar, title, footer, and subnav prop-driven\n\n* part of MIL-249: refactor(stencil): makes common stencil components prop driven\n\n* fixes MIL-249: fix(UI): subnav cards map to controls/FAQs categories and jump to section when clicked\n\n* chore: merge index.tsx from amen branch\n\n* fixes MIL-238: fix(client): guard web component registration for SSR and tests\n\n* fixes MIL-237: chore(client): centralize link card item mapping and static json payloads\n\n* feat(UI): adds section for AI chatbot\n\n* chore(prettier): config files cleanup to merge into main\n\n* chore:merging main into amen\n\n* fixes MIL-268: refactor(server): thin graphql resolvers to call services, add shared pagination helpers for services, add controls/faqs service read layer\n\n* (closes MIL-270: feat(cache): add unified cache abstraction with LRU adapter\n\n- define Cache interface (get, set, del, getOrSet) in server/cache/cache.ts\n- implement LruCacheAdapter with TTL + max items via lru-cache library\n- add deterministic key builders for controls and faqs queries in keys.ts\n- export singleton cache instance via index.ts, driven by CACHE_MAX_ITEMS env var\n- add RedisAdapter stub for future swap-in without interface changes\n)\n\n* feat(cache): implement swappable LRU/Redis abstraction with deterministic key builders\n\n* fix(graphQL): updates reseolvers from backend-optimization merge\n\n* closes MIL-272: feat(cache): add prefix invalidation strategy and mutation stubs\n\n- add optional invalidatePrefix to Cache interface for adapter flexibility\n- implement invalidatePrefix in LruCacheAdapter using keys() iterator\n- add invalidation.ts with named helpers invalidateControls + invalidateFaqs\n- add mutations.ts stub showing write → invalidate → return pattern for admin mutations\n\n* added  fixed invalidate prefix and changed some comments\n\n* part of MIL-269: fix(server): correct SQL for ILIKE escape clause in shared pagination search helper\n\n* fixes MIL-269: refactor(server): add request-scoped promise memoization to read services\n\n* fixes MIL-271: refactor(cache): add normalized read-cache key builders for shared service caching\n\n* part of MIL-229: Removed jest from stencil\n\n* part of MIL-229: Uninstalled jest\n\n* part of MIL-229: removed jest config and testing folder\n\n* Part of MIL-229: Just implemented a unit test for the control card\n\n* Merge branch ''backend-optimization'' into mila\n\n* chore: stubs testing files\n\n* chore: rename testing folder\n\n* chore: remove legacy testing stubs\n\n* chore(testing): rename and move testing folders + files\n\n* chore(testing): consolidate test layout and remove legacy stencil jest artifacts\n\n* chore: updates playwright run\n\n* chore(testing): clean up testing\n\n* part of MIL-229: chore(testing): adds unit testing for pagination and graphql integration testing\n\n* chore: linting to merge\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Annie Tadvick <annie.tadvick@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Xavier <xglover410@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Amen Stoney <amenstoney@gmail.comgit config --global user.name Amen>\nCo-authored-by: Annie Tadvick <153228151+anddude@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: milapaprika <mila.henson@protonmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Amen Stoney <112218549+tehutiboy20@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Amen Stoney <amenstoney@gmail.com>\n\n* chore: write ReadMe draft 1\n\n* merge\n\n* feature(dark mode): add white and color error inverses to tokens\n\n* feature(dark mode): add dark theme to switch out light colors\n\n* feature(dark mode): switch method semantic layering rather than overrides\n\n* feature(dark mode): extract