king. Add separate package.json in stencil.\n\n* closes MIL-128: sripts are in place, stencil runs, orchestrator exits cleanly\n\n* Part of mil-139: Create footer web component. Use as reference for further components.\n\n* chore: remove generated Stencil build output\n\n* Part of mil-139Update gitignore to account for stencil generated files.\n\n* fixes MIL-128: adds stencil build to main dev script\n\n* PR save\n\n* fixes MIL-128: updates cleanexit script to sleep before the intentional error (make the failure more apparent)\n\n* Add Aon foundations color scheme\n\n* Start of tokens.css file for stencil styling\n\n* closes MIL-130: /api/health returns JSON and GraphiQL for yoga shows up in the browser\n\n* closes MIL-132: seperates server creation and start for testing  +  proxies health check  +  mounts GraphQL\n\n* merge Mila into Elijah for backend setup, yoga server and schema (#17)\n\nCo-authored-by: milapaprika <mila.henson@protonmail.com>\n\n* closes MIL-135: graphql is created and mounts correctly, context shapes are defined, uuids are generated, post/ to graphql is stable without DB vars set\n\n* removes unused packages\n\n* Update tokens.css file to reflect Aon design foundations\n\n* Fix fon-family so that it is applied consistently. Body is inconsistent with shadow dom\n\n* Comment cleanup.\n\n* fixes footer rendering issue\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Annie Tadvick <annie.tadvick@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: milapaprika <mila.henson@protonmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Xavier <xglover410@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"743ad0107c6779b958cf5661890372e6c01c6123","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FC-OSP-6/trust-center/git/trees/743ad0107c6779b958cf5661890372e6c01c6123"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FC-OSP-6/trust-center/git/commits/046438c446745799959deba51b5599344165ffdc","verification":{"payload":"tree 743ad0107c6779b958cf5661890372e6c01c6123\nparent 5f0c07028cfd93f101528691fac068c8f0031e83\nauthor morrisxelijah <morrisxelijah@gmail.com> 1770213612 -