itter":{"date":"2026-02-02T07:00:31Z","email":"476409177@qq.com","name":"Juntao Chi"},"message":" feat: add Agent Console and refactor delegation system\n\n     - Agent Server: Introduced `agent/server.ts`, an Express-based API\n       to expose agent capabilities with streaming support.\n     - Web Console: Added `app/console` with `AgentConsole`,\n       `JobSimulation`, and `ServiceDiscovery` components for\n       intent-based agent interaction.\n     - Delegation: Refactored `app/delegation` and removed obsolete\n       components (`DelegationPanel`, `SecuritySandbox`, etc.) in favor\n       of a more streamlined architecture.\n     - UI/Theming: Removed ''Glass'' and ''Minimal'' themes to focus on the\n       core Cyberpunk aesthetic; updated layout and global styles.\n     - Libs: Added `web/lib/intents.ts` and `parser.ts` for frontend\n       intent handling.\n     - Deps: Updated package dependencies and lockfiles for both agent\n       and web workspaces.","tree":{"sha":"f5eb7767d7f8593ca6294747b3cf0461ad82963c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juntaochi/nexusflow/git/trees/f5eb7767d7f8593ca6294747b3cf0461ad82963c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juntaochi/nexusflow/git/commits/5c38463956c731385965d49bc35bedbdffc2a8f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53086415?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juntaochi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juntaochi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juntaochi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juntaochi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juntaochi","id":53086415,"login":"juntaochi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDg2NDE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juntaochi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juntaochi/received_events