://api.github.com/users/mirzakopic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mirzakopic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mirzakopic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mirzakopic","id":1658560,"login":"mirzakopic","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTg1NjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mirzakopic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mirzakopic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mirzakopic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mirzakopic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mirzakopic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mirzakopic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/dbd60403818b2a6a2820a5a1945615d5ed86d603/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T15:51:08Z","email":"1658560+mirzakopic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Mirza Kopic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T15:51:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add git ord reference app, hope it works (#14)\n\n* add git ord reference app, hope it works\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(k8s): update ord-reference-app container port from 8083 to 8080\n\nUpdate the containerPort and health check probes to use port 8080 instead of 8083 to align with the application''s actual listening port. Also fix YAML indentation for the container specification.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* docs: add ORD reference app documentation to README\n\nAdd documentation for the new ORD reference application example in the manifests table and dependency order section. The ORD reference app is a standalone Deployment + Service that can be deployed to shoot clusters via Flux without dependencies.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: add spaceship-app and super-agent deployments to ORD demo\n\nAdd Kubernetes deployments and services for spaceship-app and super-agent components to support A2A ORD demonstration. Both applications are configured with health checks, resource limits, and proper service discovery for inter-pod communication.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: update demo app images to use published container registry\n\nReplace local Docker images with versioned images from GitHub Container Registry for spaceship-app and super-agent components in the ORD reference application deployment\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: remove imagePullPolicy from ord-reference-app containers\n\nRemove imagePullPolicy: Never from spaceship-app and super-agent containers to allow normal image pulling behavior from registry instead of forcing local images only\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* docs: rename ord-reference-app to basic-ord and expand ORD demo docs\n\nRename kustomize/ord-reference-app to kustomize/basic-ord and update\nall K8s resource names, labels, selectors, and flux kustomization\nreferences. Add ORD + A2A demo section to README with port-forward\ninstructions and demo.http walkthrough. Add ord/ directory with\ninteractive HTTP client demo files.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* docs: enhance README with detailed architecture and usage instructions for ORD + A2A demo\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0540cadd0ea682003a5514c9b316243c9bc2dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/trees/c0540cadd0ea682003a5514c9b316243c9bc2dc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/commits/dbd60403818b2a6a2820a5a1945615d5ed86d603","verification":{"payload":"tree c0540cadd0ea682003a5514c9b316243c9bc2dc4\nparent 767c6eb6fb8aeaf43e7128a2a41f7900a858472e\nauthor Mirza Kopic <1658560+mirzakopic@users.noreply.github.com> 1774281068 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774281068 +0100\n\nfeat: add git ord reference app, hope it works (#14)\n\n* add git ord reference app, hope it works\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(k8s): update ord-reference-app container port from 8083 to 8080\n\nUpdate the containerPort and health check probes to use port 8080 instead of 8083 to align with the application''s actual listening port. Also fix YAML indentation for the container specification.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* docs: add ORD reference app documentation to README\n\nAdd documentation for the new ORD reference application example in the manifests table and dependency order section. The ORD reference app is a standalone Deployment + Service that can be deployed to shoot clusters via Flux without dependencies.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: add spaceship-app and super-agent deployments to ORD demo\n\nAdd Kubernetes deployments and services for spaceship-app and super-agent components to support A2A ORD demonstration. Both applications are configured with health checks, resource limits, and proper service discovery for inter-pod communication.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: update demo app images to use published container registry\n\nReplace local Docker images with versioned images from GitHub Container Registry for spaceship-app and super-agent components in the ORD reference application deployment\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: remove imagePullPolicy from ord-reference-app containers\n\nRemove imagePullPolicy: Never from spaceship-app and super-agent containers to allow normal image pulling behavior from registry instead of forcing local images only\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* docs: rename ord-reference-app to basic-ord and expand ORD demo docs\n\nRename kustomize/ord-reference-app to kustomize/basic-ord and update\nall K8s resource names, labels, selectors, and flux kustomization\nreferences. Add ORD + A2A demo section to README with port-forward\ninstructions and demo.http walkthrough. Add ord/ directory with\ninteractive HTTP client demo files.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* docs: enhance README with detailed architecture and usage instructions for ORD + A2A demo\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----