able portal refresh after feature enable/disable\n- UI: add accountPath to LuigiContext interface\n- Add Taskfile.yaml for onboarding-ui build/deploy workflow\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: wait for tool deletion before reloading portal\n\nPoll the tool resource after issuing delete requests, keeping the\n\"disabling\" state with busy indicator until the resource is fully\nremoved, then trigger a full page reload.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"9988bf863ec2d4188fb09750f1ce6db8cbbf61f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/trees/9988bf863ec2d4188fb09750f1ce6db8cbbf61f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/commits/cb1dae8911937ee2b55bb58ee6ec61af2c1342b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 9988bf863ec2d4188fb09750f1ce6db8cbbf61f4\nparent e38a07b7428fccce5077138bdb2ab0600bd394e3\nauthor Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com> 1773842841 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773842841 +0100\n\nfix: portal config reload after tool provisioning/deletion (#12)\n\n* fix: portal config reload after tool provisioning\n\n- Operator: wait for ContentConfiguration Ready condition before setting\n  tool phase to Ready, preventing the UI from triggering a reload before\n  the portal has indexed the new navigation nodes\n- UI: replace sendCustomMessage-based reload with window.location.reload()\n  for reliable portal refresh after feature enable/disable\n- UI: add accountPath to LuigiContext interface\n- Add Taskfile.yaml for onboarding-ui build/deploy workflow\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: wait for tool deletion before reloading portal\n\nPoll the tool resource after issuing delete requests, keeping the\n\"disabling\" state with busy indicator until the resource is fully\nremoved, then trigger a full page reload.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpurGZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABWMQAI6Fs/DsJdm6TASM3TJK/lsq\n+rA6SJEht9zQx7ZrHgp4KD8t42T5OTTqRll4gWWXkxc4VPJAScPvVEW4ctI6zj4v\nilEV8HNy/HPbPH8RlnqZfxokJgR90Og1QECyhb5aKF2UDMKF32lS25JDgSo/JVyp\nTYuGIrJvChK6uzhtUcZ9622gHyH4rrglyxCCAHtB3SYbp9+C3+yX4NqM5PX1OiPO\nnRdIafqUYPMkRBGaVl+fTSh6LKsmSunV5OrFzmsZqfgImxyJmSwg3hQHcpb4AZ96\ngGTayFgrbKJ2BljKE3GifO0qexhO2x8IfGlipy8YSATAMyCIc5Sj9BhRC0G0rCJA\nU79JtsxoR+vfrtu1f/JFojZIkdCdcinpAgRsC0IXErLNeALPItCfcszK6QIPkWlK\nt8DSvQpRDxmd16stiU4qRHiiNqd6DWEH3TOwTiQTxPO/OwZXeL/UF/IMo7ayQYjP\n2iYIlEfEs18JGAh6U4tC0wfGABYXFbhQutR3FIw+0+QVq6yh1s938Tufpt+MSC8o\n74cwqpywSwH0bO/RfNMtd6piK0joIgFgHMo8UX8XNz8kQpZUjMcooTnultTaWKN1\nHeaSdyORZebPsxeNG1l50GPJULZq7xK4fikBN6BethT69iaV0NeF4Bq+jdaKC5kL\nIacklMsq70hohCsGUh9f\n=8MxM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T14:07:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commit/cb1dae8911937ee2b55bb58ee6ec61af2c1342b2","node_id":"C_kwDOREFtx9oAKGNiMWRhZTg5MTE5MzdlZTJiNTViYjU4ZWU2ZWM2MWFmMmMxMzQyYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commit/e38a07b7428fccce5077138bdb2ab0600bd394e3","sha":"e38a07b7428fccce5077138bdb2ab0600bd394e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/e38a07b7428fccce5077138bdb2ab0600bd394e3"}],"sha":"cb1dae8911937ee2b55bb58ee6ec61af2c1342b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/cb1dae8911937ee2b55bb58ee6ec61af2c1342b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52737?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nexus49","id":52737,"login":"nexus49","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/e38a07b7428fccce5077138bdb2ab0600bd394e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T12:36:46Z","email":"bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com","name":"Bastian Echterhölter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T12:36:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: remove catalog types, CachedResource, and internal APIExport (#11)\n\nThe CachedResource approach for exposing catalog data to consumer\nworkspaces did not work in local KCP and the feature UI will not use\nthis pattern. Remove all related artifacts:\n\n- CachedResource manifests (crossplanecatalogs, krocatalogs, fluxcatalogs, ocmcontrollercatalogs)\n- Internal APIExport (opencp-internal.cloud) and self-binding\n- Catalog Go types, CRDs, and APIResourceSchemas\n- Catalog instance manifests\n- Integration script steps for internal export, self-binding, and cached resources\n- Taskfile internal APIExport generation\n- concept.md catalog references\n\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"6305b1ab0eaba36be1eb93543e3c65202b7f60a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/trees/6305b1ab0eaba36be1eb93543e3c65202b7f60a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/commits/e38a07b7428fccce5077138bdb2ab0600bd394e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 6305b1ab0eaba36be1eb93543e3c65202b7f60a4\nparent e7052da1ff2f507f02ad02740eff0c7f3bd127aa\nauthor Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com> 1773837406 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773837406 +0100\n\nrefactor: remove catalog types, CachedResource, and internal APIExport (#11)\n\nThe CachedResource approach for exposing catalog data to consumer\nworkspaces did not work in local KCP and the feature UI will not use\nthis pattern. Remove all related artifacts:\n\n- CachedResource manifests (crossplanecatalogs, krocatalogs, fluxcatalogs, ocmcontrollercatalogs)\n- Internal APIExport (opencp-internal.cloud) and self-binding\n- Catalog Go types, CRDs, and APIResourceSchemas\n- Catalog instance manifests\n- Integration script steps for internal export, self-binding, and cached resources\n- Taskfile internal APIExport generation\n- concept.md catalog references\n\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpupxeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA91EQAGNyhcjDglqA1scrTIeGg/LK\nn6ANkbl7wGbucYcJxBbxhjyswxEKVGpscyrBgEsJanbSC/KSCtARPs8vX7BxeNsJ\nNfwLPYLZS41pLr4bsMbOCn+lQZVXBrS8FZ8LFvnqzcbJ4pzxnYyTArx5qLoleBRd\n6+T/dw02Ky5mToWk+Y3FdPlKSrtq/uiC9JrWx/6njV+zkHHSp9YuRTl2DosBnd37\n5xj0Uhk5a9tLbXWffcEg5dO+zRkfqAtvGpCStpyqf4ISpPBYMKQE+vVfnvORmy5U\nmNxQbirlJSlrw5HWTk6+gV+FEHqKGDJaLEfBjrdLe8LunwD3fnCDqgE1X71aNkBG\n1mJP0kYJz8QMQfoUUSJdTF2YA9kMQ4vxU6NOsjTKW78/TR2QTZ8ddJN3iQb7LLNe\nSvHx1+4ac/gAYUqLv/hG3DmwOWQ2T4tIUYmTY/fmCu2TvRmpirKkJiDBNa9iiQas\nmA1XQT4lixoImPU9CEd3VRkUs5pyIUq9drSp/R6e3b6D7oILWlwICoGoaOA4VjSC\nc50hCH582GKFVyT/J9kM8Zd0jaE6x+BWIiK9CzTAH9uh5IDyYsITbG/W0LWiSE4r\nMaaJSn4b3Jp9S61x84ylXJuB+mWPTCnhFR9Wf0uI704OTJ3Ztot69UxYB+7LLlJn\nGgl4lILtTSoLw42bcTki\n=TGn7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T12:36:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commit/e38a07b7428fccce5077138bdb2ab0600bd394e3","node_id":"C_kwDOREFtx9oAKGUzOGEwN2I3NDI4ZmNjY2U1MDc3MTM4YmRiMmFiMDYwMGJkMzk0ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commit/e7052da1ff2f507f02ad02740eff0c7f3bd127aa","sha":"e7052da1ff2f507f02ad02740eff0c7f3bd127aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/e7052da1ff2f507f02ad02740eff0c7f3bd127aa"}],"sha":"e38a07b7428fccce5077138bdb2ab0600bd394e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/e38a07b7428fccce5077138bdb2ab0600bd394e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52737?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nexus49","id":52737,"login":"nexus49","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/e7052da1ff2f507f02ad02740eff0c7f3bd127aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T10:05:44Z","email":"bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com","name":"Bastian Echterhölter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T10:05:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: prevent APIExport recreation during workspace deletion (#10)\n\nReplace CreateOrUpdate with Get+Update in DeployAPIResourceSchemasSubroutine\nto avoid recreating APIExports that were already deleted by workspace teardown.\n\nWhen a KCP workspace is being deleted, resources within it (including\nAPIExports) are removed. The Finalize() method previously used\nCreateOrUpdate, which would Get → NotFound → Create, inadvertently\nrecreating the APIExport in a deleting workspace. The same defensive\npattern is applied to Process() for consistency.\n\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"960efa0012b17def2cfe126637a96897b4a068a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/trees/960efa0012b17def2cfe126637a96897b4a068a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/commits/e7052da1ff2f507f02ad02740eff0c7f3bd127aa","verification":{"payload":"tree 960efa0012b17def2cfe126637a96897b4a068a6\nparent 6cb8dc88d367b181dc384f4833d457b40efd5d06\nauthor Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com> 1773828344 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773828344 +0100\n\nfix: prevent APIExport recreation during workspace deletion (#10)\n\nReplace CreateOrUpdate with Get+Update in DeployAPIResourceSchemasSubroutine\nto avoid recreating APIExports that were already deleted by workspace teardown.\n\nWhen a KCP workspace is being deleted, resources within it (including\nAPIExports) are removed. The Finalize() method previously used\nCreateOrUpdate, which would Get → NotFound → Create, inadvertently\nrecreating the APIExport in a deleting workspace. The same defensive\npattern is applied to Process() for consistency.\n\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpunj4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkcwQAKJCXyeNO8hziJlPJsHc8dw3\nXJinjKns/1TATGjrblgDF2YplxpWFLDytOw6EmRzra/omb2+JOV1J6DFjlyKcNCn\ncXcQ/jr27nIHxvUUQ0yJz5o06C7mDJWPMHxibru9iuPFrVsw3Go9yrmh6X4zPQMP\nhDnCOBXSMr0Pljb31EgJ+8UxX9vQh8mtsdZr543DtAz0wi9ML3vVsKkBgE0FE+V0\nwidfwoImhWfBHA+6CjAAMwqfk5ZmrLRNkTOrdmgeCj0+yagc+jiFaX4acMjw2A3a\nwOiBckKNLotOmzr+lcF90GtbqONqF/IxO+Ei7j7lUYhvcdFztKLSwjbKPMVYvAsR\nwFRBpG5i8nlfGiw2TKR01tn4N51VWkud5Cn1wiSnUJCcQBJaCKpDk2EWu/8GfPSz\nrgpb7815Da0BBYYQV2bDg+HgRAO8OvOVKwMWGqhT4xZVqi00nRmFi/h90z2OlE1r\nvmWrr+I/LkJeZ7nBOvWb7WDsVtmKyI3q+tIar0Hj+F4vqFoyPTwnh5J9kI1TYi9u\ntizZy07bsRQlt0ea7nrb8pJ5y/O+D6bfmIFdqG9iChy9+KplYeG59OuXtjRSd7Ki\npx2Bd2dve7DoedqFzzOs7dkAfHdTV2NyRD+KXVW6OewXvy8cX42mlEMpAFZ1Vb7d\nwW4+T1niKovRGIHrhDb6\n=nKsd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T10:05:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commit/e7052da1ff2f507f02ad02740eff0c7f3bd127aa","node_id":"C_kwDOREFtx9oAKGU3MDUyZGExZmYyZjUwN2YwMmFkMDI3NDBlZmYwYzdmM2JkMTI3YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commit/6cb8dc88d367b181dc384f4833d457b40efd5d06","sha":"6cb8dc88d367b181dc384f4833d457b40efd5d06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/6cb8dc88d367b181dc384f4833d457b40efd5d06"}],"sha":"e7052da1ff2f507f02ad02740eff0c7f3bd127aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/e7052da1ff2f507f02ad02740eff0c7f3bd127aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52737?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nexus49","id":52737,"login":"nexus49","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/6cb8dc88d367b181dc384f4833d457b40efd5d06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T08:46:22Z","email":"bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com","name":"Bastian Echterhölter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T08:46:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: rename API domain from openmcp.cloud to opencp.cloud (#9)\n\n* feat: rename API domain from openmcp.cloud to opencp.cloud\n\nRename all API groups, APIExport names, APIResourceSchema names,\nCRD files, entity type identifiers, display names, UI queries,\nand content configurations to reflect the project rename from\nOpenMCP to Open Control Planes (OpenCP).\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: rename workspace-type file to correct opencp naming\n\nRenamed workspace-type-openmcp-init.yaml to workspace-type-opencp-init.yaml to fix inconsistent naming convention in demo manifests\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* refactor: rename openmcp to opencp throughout project manifests\n\n- Rename workspace type from openmcp-init to opencp-init\n- Move provider manifests from openmcp/ to opencp/ directory\n- Update API export names to use opencp prefix\n- Regenerate identity hash for content configurations\n- Maintain consistent naming convention across all manifest files\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: recover accidentally deleted example files from 7886a2b\n\nThe graphql-gateway examples (flux kustomization, kustomize manifests,\nand KRO ResourceGraphDefinition) were unintentionally removed in commit\n7886a2b. Restore them from the parent commit.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* refactor: rename OpenCP to OpenControlPlane in display text\n\nUpdate user-facing labels, titles, and descriptions to use the full\n\"OpenControlPlane\" name instead of the abbreviated \"OpenCP\".\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n-