}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commit/6cb8dc88d367b181dc384f4833d457b40efd5d06","node_id":"C_kwDOREFtx9oAKDZjYjhkYzg4ZDM2N2IxODFkYzM4NGY0ODMzZDQ1N2I0MGVmZDVkMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commit/7886a2bb4837d70e965ea694624ae6f325e2bc97","sha":"7886a2bb4837d70e965ea694624ae6f325e2bc97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/7886a2bb4837d70e965ea694624ae6f325e2bc97"}],"sha":"6cb8dc88d367b181dc384f4833d457b40efd5d06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/6cb8dc88d367b181dc384f4833d457b40efd5d06"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52737?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nexus49","id":52737,"login":"nexus49","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/commits/7886a2bb4837d70e965ea694624ae6f325e2bc97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T20:06:04Z","email":"bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com","name":"Bastian Echterhölter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T20:06:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: APIExport finalizer controller and APIBinding-based deletion guards (#8)\n\n* feat: APIExport finalizer, tool uninstall safeguards, and UI fixes\n\n- Add APIExport controller (subroutine pattern) to block APIExport deletion\n  until no APIBindings reference it; add apibindings get/list to openmcp.cloud.\n- Add PreDeleteChecks for Flux, KRO, OCM, Crossplane; fix content config\n  icons for Helm Releases and Deployers.\n- Ignore generated toolcrd APIResourceSchemas; add version label margin in\n  features UI.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: block managed control plane deletion until tool resources are gone\n\nKeep ManagedControlPlane finalization aligned with the openmcp.cloud APIExport by waiting for the exported Crossplane, Flux, KRO, and OCMController resources to disappear before deleting the backing MCP.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: delete APIBindings before disabling tools\n\nRemove the tool APIBinding first so the openmcp.cloud export is no longer consumed, then uninstall the tool resource from the UI. Refresh the openmcp.cloud manifest hash alongside the UI teardown change.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: replace per-resource pre-delete checks with APIBinding-based guards\n\nReplace the PreDeleteResourceCheck GVR-based approach with APIExport/APIBinding\nchecks. Instead of listing individual resource types before allowing tool\nuninstall, we now check whether any APIBindings still reference the tool''s\nAPIExport. This is simpler, more reliable, and aligns with the KCP resource\nlifecycle.\n\nAlso add APIResourceSchemaProtectionSubroutine and controller to prevent\nschemas from being deleted while APIExports referencing them still have\nactive bindings.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* refactor: migrate from deprecated corev1.Endpoints to discoveryv1.EndpointSlice\n\ncorev1.Endpoints is deprecated since v1.33. Use discoveryv1.EndpointSlice\ndirectly for the selector-less gardener-api-proxy Service instead of relying\non the legacy Endpoints API and Kubernetes auto-mirroring.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0dced1e18b3b6da1d6e13e5be1f8b666adb1385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/trees/b0dced1e18b3b6da1d6e13e5be1f8b666adb1385"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/commits/7886a2bb4837d70e965ea694624ae6f325e2bc97","verification":{"payload":"tree b0dced1e18b3b6da1d6e13e5be1f8b666adb1385\nparent 05bf1f6ea0bb7c2601d13b0217bda0a7c4c90332\nauthor Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com> 1773777964 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773777964 +0100\n\nfeat: APIExport finalizer controller and APIBinding-based deletion guards (#8)\n\n* feat: APIExport finalizer, tool uninstall safeguards, and UI fixes\n\n- Add APIExport controller (subroutine pattern) to block APIExport deletion\n  until no APIBindings reference it; add apibindings get/list to openmcp.cloud.\n- Add PreDeleteChecks for Flux, KRO, OCM, Crossplane; fix content config\n  icons for Helm Releases and Deployers.\n- Ignore generated toolcrd APIResourceSchemas; add version label margin in\n  features UI.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: block managed control plane deletion until tool resources are gone\n\nKeep ManagedControlPlane finalization aligned with the openmcp.cloud APIExport by waiting for the exported Crossplane, Flux, KRO, and OCMController resources to disappear before deleting the backing MCP.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: delete APIBindings before disabling tools\n\nRemove the tool APIBinding first so the openmcp.cloud export is no longer consumed, then uninstall the tool resource from the UI. Refresh the openmcp.cloud manifest hash alongside the UI teardown change.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: replace per-resource pre-delete checks with APIBinding-based guards\n\nReplace the PreDeleteResourceCheck GVR-based approach with APIExport/APIBinding\nchecks. Instead of listing individual resource types before allowing tool\nuninstall, we now check whether any APIBindings still reference the tool''s\nAPIExport. This is simpler, more reliable, and aligns with the KCP resource\nlifecycle.\n\nAlso add APIResourceSchemaProtectionSubroutine and controller to prevent\nschemas from being deleted while APIExports referencing them still have\nactive bindings.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* refactor: migrate from deprecated corev1.Endpoints to discoveryv1.EndpointSlice\n\ncorev1.Endpoints is d