cluster, and openmcp setup\n- Add openmcp-init-operator with crossplane and sync agent subroutines\n- Add helm chart for init operator with initializer and operator deployments\n- Add hack scripts for flux installation and platform mesh integration\n- Add openmcp manifests for local environment configuration\n- Add demo provider manifests and APIExport definitions\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: add dotenv support and configuration docs for local demo\n\n- Add .env.example with OCM repository/component overrides\n- Enable dotenv loading in Taskfile.yml\n- Document configuration in demo-setup.md\n- Update apiexport identityHash for platform-mesh\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: ignore external/\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: add local event showcase demo setup\n\n- Add Taskfile with targets for local KCP, kind cluster, and openmcp setup\n- Add openmcp-init-operator with crossplane and sync agent subroutines\n- Add helm chart for init operator with initializer and operator deployments\n- Add hack scripts for flux installation and platform mesh integration\n- Add openmcp manifests for local environment configuration\n- Add demo provider manifests and APIExport definitions\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: add dotenv support and configuration docs for local demo\n\n- Add .env.example with OCM repository/component overrides\n- Enable dotenv loading in Taskfile.yml\n- Document configuration in demo-setup.md\n- Update apiexport identityHash for platform-mesh\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: ignore external/\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: adding prompt before deletion\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: handle both http and https schemes in OCM image reference rewriting\n\nOCM components return image references with http:// prefix but the sed\nsubstitution only matched https://, leaving invalid image names that\nKubernetes rejected with InvalidImageName.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: create openmcp-system namespace before registry-ca secret and update identity hash\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: gitignore kubeconfigs, add registry-ca configmap and permission claims script\n\n- Gitignore hack/kubeconfigs/ and remove tracked platform.kubeconfig\n  containing cluster credentials\n- Add registry-ca ConfigMap creation step in Taskfile\n- Update CA bundle ConfigMap reference to registry-ca in providerconfig\n- Update identity hash in apiexport manifest\n- Add accept-permission-claims.sh helper for kcp APIBinding setup\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(openmcp-init-operator): introduce ManagedControlPlane CRD and refactor operator\n\nReplace APIBinding-based reconciliation with a new ManagedControlPlane CRD\nas the trigger for OpenMCP workspace initialization.\n\n- Define ManagedControlPlane CRD (cluster-scoped, with Phase status)\n- Create ManagedControlPlaneReconciler replacing OpenMCPInitReconciler\n- Refactor CreateMCPSubroutine and SetupSyncAgentSubroutine to use\n  ManagedControlPlane instead of APIBinding\n- Change APIExport name from crossplane.openmcp.cloud to\n  crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud\n- Remove ProviderMetadata and ContentConfiguration creation from\n  SetupSyncAgentSubroutine\n- Delete dead code: SetupFluxSubroutine, DeployAPIExportBindingSubroutine,\n  icon_data.go, flux-values.yaml\n- Remove initializer deployment from Helm chart\n- Update RBAC with ManagedControlPlane permissions\n- Bump chart version to 0.4.0\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(openmcp-init-operator): address review findings for ManagedControlPlane refactor\n\n- Remove WithReadOnly() from ManagedControlPlaneReconciler so status\n  updates and finalizer management are persisted\n- Delete dead internal/predicates/ package (APIBinding predicates no\n  longer used)\n- Set Phase=Provisioning at the start of CreateMCPSubroutine.Process\n  before any work begins\n- Tighten RBAC: split status subresource rules to only allow update\n  and patch verbs\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* chore(openmcp-init-operator): upgrade to Go 1.26 and golangci-lint v2\n\nUpgrade go.mod from Go 1.25.6 to Go 1.26.0 so that golangci-lint\n@latest (v2.x, built with Go 1.26) works without OOM issues. Revert\nthe v1.64.8 pin back to @latest. Run go mod tidy to clean up direct\nvs indirect dependency classification.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(openmcp-init-operator): introduce ManagedControlPlane CRD and refactor operator (#2)\n\n* feat(openmcp-init-operator): introduce ManagedControlPlane CRD and refactor operator\n\nReplace APIBinding-based reconciliation with a new ManagedControlPlane CRD\nas the trigger for OpenMCP workspace initialization.\n\n- Define ManagedControlPlane CRD (cluster-scoped, with Phase status)\n- Create ManagedControlPlaneReconciler replacing OpenMCPInitReconciler\n- Refactor CreateMCPSubroutine and SetupSyncAgentSubroutine to use\n  ManagedControlPlane instead of APIBinding\n- Change APIExport name from crossplane.openmcp.cloud to\n  crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud\n- Remove ProviderMetadata and ContentConfiguration creation from\n  SetupSyncAgentSubroutine\n- Delete dead code: SetupFluxSubroutine, DeployAPIExportBindingSubroutine,\n  icon_data.go, flux-values.yaml\n- Remove initializer deployment from Helm chart\n- Update RBAC with ManagedControlPlane permissions\n- Bump chart version to 0.4.0\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(openmcp-init-operator): address review findings for ManagedControlPlane refactor\n\n- Remove WithReadOnly() from ManagedControlPlaneReconciler so status\n  updates and finalizer management are persisted\n- Delete dead internal/predicates/ package (APIBinding predicates no\n  longer used)\n- Set Phase=Provisioning at the start of CreateMCPSubroutine.Process\n  before any work begins\n- Tighten RBAC: split status subresource rules to only allow update\n  and patch verbs\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* chore(openmcp-init-operator): upgrade to Go 1.26 and golangci-lint v2\n\nUpgrade go.mod from Go 1.25.6 to Go 1.26.0 so that golangci-lint\n@latest (v2.x, built with Go 1.26) works without OOM issues. Revert\nthe v1.64.8 pin back to @latest. Run go mod tidy to clean up direct\nvs indirect dependency classification.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: configure KCP init-agent for ManagedControlPlane initialization (#3)\n\n* feat: configure KCP init-agent for ManagedControlPlane initialization\n\nReplace the custom initializer subcommand with KCP init-agent\nconfiguration via InitTemplate and InitTarget resources. The KCP\ninit-agent (already deployed by platform-mesh) now creates a\nManagedControlPlane resource in each new account workspace.\n\n- Add InitTemplate and InitTarget manifests in demo/manifests/init-agent/\n- Remove initializer subcommand, LogicalClusterReconciler, and\n  InitializeWorkspaceSubroutine from openmcp-init-operator\n- Remove InitializerConfig from operator config\n- Update integration script to apply init-agent manifests\n- Update concept.md Phase 2 description\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(openmcp-onboarding-ui): add Crossplane onboarding micro-frontend (#4)\n\nAngular-based Luigi web component that guides users through enabling\nCrossplane in their workspace via a two-step flow:\n1. Create APIBinding to crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud\n2. Create Crossplane resource (v1.20.1 + provider-kubernetes v0.15.0)\n\nIncludes project scaffold, GraphQL service layer using Apollo Client,\nContentConfiguration for portal registration under OpenMCP > Crossplane,\nand Dockerfile/nginx config for container deployment.\n\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(demo): bump Go image to 1.26 and update generated manifests\n\n- Bump Dockerfile base image from golang:1.25 to golang:1.26 to match\n  go.mod requirement\n- Add ManagedControlPlane to APIExport latestResourceSchemas\n- Update generated deepcopy and CRD/APIResourceSchema manifests\n- Fix init-agent manifests target workspace to platform-mesh-system\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(openmcp-init-operator): split ManagedControlPlane to core.openmcp.cloud API group\n\nMove ManagedControlPlane from crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud to its\nown core.openmcp.cloud API group, reflecting its role as a core platform\nresource. Crossplane types remain at crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud.\nBoth groups are aggregated under the single openmcp.cloud APIExport.\n\n- Create api/core/v1alpha1 package with core.openmcp.cloud group\n- Move ManagedControlPlane types and constants to new package\n- Update all Go imports to use corev1alpha1 alias\n- Split RBAC rules by API group in Helm chart\n- Update Taskfile to merge two generated APIExport files\n- Fix init-template.yaml apiVersion to core.openmcp.cloud/v1alpha1\n- Regenerate CRDs, deepcopy, and KCP API resource schemas\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(openmcp-init-operator): use cluster ID instead of kcp.io/path annotation\n\nThe kcp.io/path annotation is not injected by KCP when resources are\naccessed via the APIExport virtual workspace. Use the cluster ID from\nthe multicluster context instead — KCP''s /clusters/ URL accepts both\nworkspace paths and cluster IDs.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(demo): add onboarding UI Helm chart, deployment, and live provisioning feedback\n\n- Add Helm chart for openmcp-onboarding-ui with deploy, service, HTTPRoute,\n  and ServiceAccount templates following generic-resource-ui pattern\n- Harden Dockerfile (non-root nginx, proper permissions, CMD)\n- Add gzip compression and URL normalization to nginx.conf\n- Fix Apollo v4 breaking changes (ApolloClientOptions, setContext, HttpHeaders)\n- Fix GraphQL API group: openmcp_io -> crossplane_services_openmcp_cloud\n- Remove hardcoded path from APIBinding mutation (bind to local workspace)\n- Add GraphQL subscription for live Crossplane provisioning status updates\n- Add provisioning state with busy indicator and phase display in UI\n- Migrate APIExport manifests from v1alpha1 to v1alpha2 with verb-scoped\n  permission claims for RBAC and contentconfigurations\n- Add ensureAPIExportBindRBAC to operator for per-workspace bind permissions\n- Update RBAC binding from system:anonymous to system:authenticated\n- Add Crossplane phase constants (Provisioning/Ready) and status tracking\n- Add UI build/load/deploy section to integration script\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* Feat/phase4 content configurations (#5)\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(demo): build api-syncagent locally and move gardener API to own provider workspace\n\n- Clone and build kcp api-syncagent from source in the integration script,\n  push to local registry (localhost:5002), and configure the operator to\n  deploy it from kind-registry:5002 on MCP clusters\n- Add SyncAgent config (chartURL, imageRepository, imageTag) to the\n  openmcp-init-operator with Helm values and CLI flag wiring\n- Move gardener APIExport and APIResourceSchema to a dedicated\n  root:providers:gardener workspace (out of the openmcp provider)\n- Refactor gardener-init-operator subroutines and update concept doc\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix gardener kind + kind access notes\n\n* fix upstream crossplane version until openmcp fixes it, bug spec.providers.availableProviders[0].versions[0]: Invalid value:\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: Moritz Marby <moritz.marby@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mirza Kopic <mirza.kopic@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4f8e586664074829daba951e508c27a66c6c172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/trees/d4f8e586664074829daba951e508c27a66c6c172"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmcp-project/local-event-showcase/git/commits/72b672d7f24aeeaf7e49db9cdaa6647a36aa9a93","verification":{"payload":"tree d4f8e586664074829daba951e508c27a66c6c172\nparent 9712666931910e3cc7f7b8e2e170e2174787db58\nauthor Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com> 1773735832 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773735832 +0100\n\nfeat: demo-setup (#1)\n\n* chore: update README\n\n* feat: add local event showcase demo setup\n\n- Add Taskfile with targets for local KCP, kind cluster, and openmcp setup\n- Add openmcp-init-operator with crossplane and sync agent subroutines\n- Add helm chart for init operator with initializer and operator deployments\n- Add hack scripts for flux installation and platform mesh integration\n- Add openmcp manifests for local environment configuration\n- Add demo provider manifests and APIExport definitions\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: add dotenv support and configuration docs for local demo\n\n- Add .env.example with OCM repository/component overrides\n- Enable dotenv loading in Taskfile.yml\n- Document configuration in demo-setup.md\n- Update apiexport identityHash for platform-mesh\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: ignore external/\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: add local event showcase demo setup\n\n- Add Taskfile with targets for local KCP, kind cluster, and openmcp setup\n- Add openmcp-init-operator with crossplane and sync agent subroutines\n- Add helm chart for init operator with initializer and operator deployments\n- Add hack scripts for flux installation and platform mesh integration\n- Add openmcp manifests for local environment configuration\n- Add demo provider manifests and APIExport definitions\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: add dotenv support and configuration docs for local demo\n\n- Add .env.example with OCM repository/component overrides\n- Enable dotenv loading in Taskfile.yml\n- Document configuration in demo-setup.md\n- Update apiexport identityHash for platform-mesh\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: ignore external/\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: adding prompt before deletion\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: handle both http and https schemes in OCM image reference rewriting\n\nOCM components return image references with http:// prefix but the sed\nsubstitution only matched https://, leaving invalid image names that\nKubernetes rejected with InvalidImageName.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: create openmcp-system namespace before registry-ca secret and update identity hash\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix: gitignore kubeconfigs, add registry-ca configmap and permission claims script\n\n- Gitignore hack/kubeconfigs/ and remove tracked platform.kubeconfig\n  containing cluster credentials\n- Add registry-ca ConfigMap creation step in Taskfile\n- Update CA bundle ConfigMap reference to registry-ca in providerconfig\n- Update identity hash in apiexport manifest\n- Add accept-permission-claims.sh helper for kcp APIBinding setup\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(openmcp-init-operator): introduce ManagedControlPlane CRD and refactor operator\n\nReplace APIBinding-based reconciliation with a new ManagedControlPlane CRD\nas the trigger for OpenMCP workspace initialization.\n\n- Define ManagedControlPlane CRD (cluster-scoped, with Phase status)\n- Create ManagedControlPlaneReconciler replacing OpenMCPInitReconciler\n- Refactor CreateMCPSubroutine and SetupSyncAgentSubroutine to use\n  ManagedControlPlane instead of APIBinding\n- Change APIExport name from crossplane.openmcp.cloud to\n  crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud\n- Remove ProviderMetadata and ContentConfiguration creation from\n  SetupSyncAgentSubroutine\n- Delete dead code: SetupFluxSubroutine, DeployAPIExportBindingSubroutine,\n  icon_data.go, flux-values.yaml\n- Remove initializer deployment from Helm chart\n- Update RBAC with ManagedControlPlane permissions\n- Bump chart version to 0.4.0\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(openmcp-init-operator): address review findings for ManagedControlPlane refactor\n\n- Remove WithReadOnly() from ManagedControlPlaneReconciler so status\n  updates and finalizer management are persisted\n- Delete dead internal/predicates/ package (APIBinding predicates no\n  longer used)\n- Set Phase=Provisioning at the start of CreateMCPSubroutine.Process\n  before any work begins\n- Tighten RBAC: split status subresource rules to only allow update\n  and patch verbs\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* chore(openmcp-init-operator): upgrade to Go 1.26 and golangci-lint v2\n\nUpgrade go.mod from Go 1.25.6 to Go 1.26.0 so that golangci-lint\n@latest (v2.x, built with Go 1.26) works without OOM issues. Revert\nthe v1.64.8 pin back to @latest. Run go mod tidy to clean up direct\nvs indirect dependency classification.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(openmcp-init-operator): introduce ManagedControlPlane CRD and refactor operator (#2)\n\n* feat(openmcp-init-operator): introduce ManagedControlPlane CRD and refactor operator\n\nReplace APIBinding-based reconciliation with a new ManagedControlPlane CRD\nas the trigger for OpenMCP workspace initialization.\n\n- Define ManagedControlPlane CRD (cluster-scoped, with Phase status)\n- Create ManagedControlPlaneReconciler replacing OpenMCPInitReconciler\n- Refactor CreateMCPSubroutine and SetupSyncAgentSubroutine to use\n  ManagedControlPlane instead of APIBinding\n- Change APIExport name from crossplane.openmcp.cloud to\n  crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud\n- Remove ProviderMetadata and ContentConfiguration creation from\n  SetupSyncAgentSubroutine\n- Delete dead code: SetupFluxSubroutine, DeployAPIExportBindingSubroutine,\n  icon_data.go, flux-values.yaml\n- Remove initializer deployment from Helm chart\n- Update RBAC with ManagedControlPlane permissions\n- Bump chart version to 0.4.0\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(openmcp-init-operator): address review findings for ManagedControlPlane refactor\n\n- Remove WithReadOnly() from ManagedControlPlaneReconciler so status\n  updates and finalizer management are persisted\n- Delete dead internal/predicates/ package (APIBinding predicates no\n  longer used)\n- Set Phase=Provisioning at the start of CreateMCPSubroutine.Process\n  before any work begins\n- Tighten RBAC: split status subresource rules to only allow update\n  and patch verbs\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* chore(openmcp-init-operator): upgrade to Go 1.26 and golangci-lint v2\n\nUpgrade go.mod from Go 1.25.6 to Go 1.26.0 so that golangci-lint\n@latest (v2.x, built with Go 1.26) works without OOM issues. Revert\nthe v1.64.8 pin back to @latest. Run go mod tidy to clean up direct\nvs indirect dependency classification.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: configure KCP init-agent for ManagedControlPlane initialization (#3)\n\n* feat: configure KCP init-agent for ManagedControlPlane initialization\n\nReplace the custom initializer subcommand with KCP init-agent\nconfiguration via InitTemplate and InitTarget resources. The KCP\ninit-agent (already deployed by platform-mesh) now creates a\nManagedControlPlane resource in each new account workspace.\n\n- Add InitTemplate and InitTarget manifests in demo/manifests/init-agent/\n- Remove initializer subcommand, LogicalClusterReconciler, and\n  InitializeWorkspaceSubroutine from openmcp-init-operator\n- Remove InitializerConfig from operator config\n- Update integration script to apply init-agent manifests\n- Update concept.md Phase 2 description\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(openmcp-onboarding-ui): add Crossplane onboarding micro-frontend (#4)\n\nAngular-based Luigi web component that guides users through enabling\nCrossplane in their workspace via a two-step flow:\n1. Create APIBinding to crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud\n2. Create Crossplane resource (v1.20.1 + provider-kubernetes v0.15.0)\n\nIncludes project scaffold, GraphQL service layer using Apollo Client,\nContentConfiguration for portal registration under OpenMCP > Crossplane,\nand Dockerfile/nginx config for container deployment.\n\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(demo): bump Go image to 1.26 and update generated manifests\n\n- Bump Dockerfile base image from golang:1.25 to golang:1.26 to match\n  go.mod requirement\n- Add ManagedControlPlane to APIExport latestResourceSchemas\n- Update generated deepcopy and CRD/APIResourceSchema manifests\n- Fix init-agent manifests target workspace to platform-mesh-system\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(openmcp-init-operator): split ManagedControlPlane to core.openmcp.cloud API group\n\nMove ManagedControlPlane from crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud to its\nown core.openmcp.cloud API group, reflecting its role as a core platform\nresource. Crossplane types remain at crossplane.services.openmcp.cloud.\nBoth groups are aggregated under the single openmcp.cloud APIExport.\n\n- Create api/core/v1alpha1 package with core.openmcp.cloud group\n- Move ManagedControlPlane types and constants to new package\n- Update all Go imports to use corev1alpha1 alias\n- Split RBAC rules by API group in Helm chart\n- Update Taskfile to merge two generated APIExport files\n- Fix init-template.yaml apiVersion to core.openmcp.cloud/v1alpha1\n- Regenerate CRDs, deepcopy, and KCP API resource schemas\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(openmcp-init-operator): use cluster ID instead of kcp.io/path annotation\n\nThe kcp.io/path annotation is not injected by KCP when resources are\naccessed via the APIExport virtual workspace. Use the cluster ID from\nthe multicluster context instead — KCP''s /clusters/ URL accepts both\nworkspace paths and cluster IDs.\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(demo): add onboarding UI Helm chart, deployment, and live provisioning feedback\n\n- Add Helm chart for openmcp-onboarding-ui with deploy, service, HTTPRoute,\n  and ServiceAccount templates following generic-resource-ui pattern\n- Harden Dockerfile (non-root nginx, proper permissions, CMD)\n- Add gzip compression and URL normalization to nginx.conf\n- Fix Apollo v4 breaking changes (ApolloClientOptions, setContext, HttpHeaders)\n- Fix GraphQL API group: openmcp_io -> crossplane_services_openmcp_cloud\n- Remove hardcoded path from APIBinding mutation (bind to local workspace)\n- Add GraphQL subscription for live Crossplane provisioning status updates\n- Add provisioning state with busy indicator and phase display in UI\n- Migrate APIExport manifests from v1alpha1 to v1alpha2 with verb-scoped\n  permission claims for RBAC and contentconfigurations\n- Add ensureAPIExportBindRBAC to operator for per-workspace bind permissions\n- Update RBAC binding from system:anonymous to system:authenticated\n- Add Crossplane phase constants (Provisioning/Ready) and status tracking\n- Add UI build/load/deploy section to integration script\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* Feat/phase4 content configurations (#5)\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat(demo): build api-syncagent locally and move gardener API to own provider workspace\n\n- Clone and build kcp api-syncagent from source in the integration script,\n  push to local registry (localhost:5002), and configure the operator to\n  deploy it from kind-registry:5002 on MCP clusters\n- Add SyncAgent config (chartURL, imageRepository, imageTag) to the\n  openmcp-init-operator with Helm values and CLI flag wiring\n- Move gardener APIExport and APIResourceSchema to a dedicated\n  root:providers:gardener workspace (out of the openmcp provider)\n- Refactor gardener-init-operator subroutines and update concept doc\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* feat: iterate\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\n* fix gardener kind + kind access notes\n\n* fix upstream crossplane version until openmcp fixes it, bug spec.providers.availableProviders[0].versions[0]: Invalid value:\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: Moritz Marby <moritz.marby@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mirza Kopic <mirza.kopic@sap.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuQ+YCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX80QACVRG0jZe7Dvznu7GWOdZyYE\nFESOsy0Jg5J8obEoQSjLdat63jXl3yZm/+tfMbmZlaa5lYquSjR5YWm723tpvuZW\n1p7ldiwU0f03wLw/VOFzRM8olJttzIsvRMg17ve+/LmEkkj0fuQ0FzIlR9pYGFdk\nuj+y+1eTCz3sL82irX/oOpE+XTI1pULSwnAjFN9fsm0kmEzrPzsHt2mu2IiZy1BN\ncisbcsobM2NO6JboZOHy8PmB4FCNZVFKpWEejJMLAYEUq5AyhmDz1XdiBzP06OO2\n52ZKU8ITb5al1FL3anM8xQO28TybNjo62wvRSjKMhWJQOQp71nAiLNzNpFJzjiW0\n+gsqDr6BF7EkFssHaBCKU1iNCIK+FzXoXJdxLs0Gw4koYelNeOwvgpajGQP+OmE4\nP280iGHbzyAwvfaE0Fvs/SRU+1W8KPBUx2FVg1hrukQavFdsyy7H6VNNkjzKK1Kg\nQEpjdfLWS2DvYJI/ntRDlAGoJtu0UdeVXYTOMgPYlJS01xJBdcjP3OjMi5Fa7FNp\nHtdd36Mj88jAJboPO1yAPFpo1wc9GvAZ49Peh2ocQZFaN+JYIHk0nC0Fc/o6l/qS\nzaTlCRGzVU51QCJLiPa9+Y2wE0DsrZiGAVWi3IvxWK6MRixuWzfSowPkJ7Il7qIL\n9pIrB5n2FxjsUeygEWeR\n=cOim\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T08:23:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.git