ps://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vpittamp","id":86859627,"login":"vpittamp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2ODU5NjI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PittampalliOrg/vibe-coding-platform/commits/722d81ec20cdc99b9202e1a88eb5c7122ef779eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T14:55:40Z","email":"vinod@pittampalli.com","name":"Vinod Pittampalli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T14:55:40Z","email":"vinod@pittampalli.com","name":"Vinod Pittampalli"},"message":"Refactor chat workflow to use step function for AI streaming\n\nReplace DurableAgent with a custom step function that creates the\nAnthropic model inside the step boundary. This avoids workflow\nserialization issues with model functions while maintaining\ndurability through the step function mechanism.\n\n- Extract streamWithAnthropic step function to separate file\n- Simplify workflow to call step function with primitive args\n- Remove DurableAgent dependency for basic chat functionality\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"607ab5a9967b51fa2097b638bd46ead0870ce2ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PittampalliOrg/vibe-coding-platform/git/trees/607ab5a9967b51fa2097b638bd46ead0870ce2ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PittampalliOrg/vibe-coding-platform/git/commits/722d81ec20cdc99b9202e1a88eb5c7122ef779eb","verification":{"payload":"tree 607ab5a9967b51fa2097b638bd46ead0870ce2ea\nparent b290888bc28b989b94b5de17981e3345e72ba399\nauthor Vinod Pittampalli <vinod@pittampalli.com> 1769784940 -0500\ncommitter Vinod Pittampalli <vinod@pittampalli.com> 1769784940 -0500\n\nRefactor chat workflow to use step function for AI streaming\n\nReplace DurableAgent with a custom step function that creates the\nAnthropic model inside the step boundary. This avoids workflow\nserialization issues with model functions while maintaining\ndurability through the step function mechanism.\n\n- Extract streamWithAnthropic step function to separate file\n- Simplify workflow to call step function with primitive args\n- Remove DurableAgent dependency for basic chat functionality\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAghg+avtU5VrOZyx5UhSyqJchw8H\nDOjCc/h6OQ642D6jsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJCGZv1nTpqwLAsvJduqR6kQ+Go21yhWjUqFOPzLvsfm1c2QiHsJIjdj6ghkgB5Jv4\nTcWCBzVN2dAcobhYv4EQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86859627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vpittamp","id":86859627,"login":"vpittamp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2ODU5NjI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vpittamp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub