cdaf20986080d11e3ce067606ddadf03f0651b580e1f746eec5c8133bfL92-R91)\n[[10]](diffhunk://#diff-0bc316cdaf20986080d11e3ce067606ddadf03f0651b580e1f746eec5c8133bfL467-R464)\n\n* Removed the custom `MarkdownRenderer` component and its associated\ncode, as it is no longer needed with the adoption of `Streamdown`.\n\n**Dependency and configuration updates:**\n\n* Updated `package.json` files to remove `react-markdown`, `remark-gfm`,\nand `rehype-raw` dependencies and add `streamdown` as a new dependency\nfor both projects.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-3c8075b8a95131416e3856c63c1c28bdb94a30f320b0065b2ce9586e91168dccL40-L45)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-76ef8e0a9755e6f1a85dd18d222ac6ace40e838e7f21a552e2b1592247946ab1L25-R25)\n\n* Updated Tailwind and build configuration files to include\n`streamdown`''s distribution files for proper styling and integration.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-72477083d1a4198c17e7ca54cf97560fc108079f3ea55004730eb5fb99367d6cR3)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-261c16ce1a55260f7746845509ed30efc060338b4af10c1bd5f3da8d041f852eR7)\n\n### Demo URL\n\nAwaiting preview deploy.\n\n### Type of Change\n\n- [ ] New Example\n- [x] Example updates (Bug fixes, new features, etc.)\n- [ ] Other (changes to the codebase, but not to examples)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpNIdDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzFEQAJvxlaA7IohdqfFJmtFNHFSX\nnzg91DN2oSbssqedqqtyJMp1+ZVeX4fmHl6Dtm68eSff6ESgize5XIgZYZgACLGv\nnqb0Uup0vdTYIFuQdZd+8V8m/CPDp3OP5bm403coWialrO8zvpQfCAumOKGwaQrS\nyH6CqwlK2dGM3x/oiwwqPYA+qjFiTSkkjzq4m7Y+omQ3ifgpqYXxUFe5UQ9dYrpZ\nWRuTukhsPCFd36MSBbANUYJ9XjX+lk0i6vM7VmKKqQ1rDlO//Lw5UnvubcBUU0gN\n4nSgqAeJyBMjjyNTXdECvY94Pc+DEP7L0XW6E52NPhkapeH9QbMb+HFyKl/W6FS/\ncmNf/9deGKyxKyA86cknkIrr4ahinV1okdWk98vZjU3rRHHeXb84ch6UsDC8jBUi\nFHON6TJ74lt2fObyaNaqQctCId8TFqXNQW/+ki3oHB4H72V9Vrd+iRdx40K1qYT5\nQalpe+NW+NZD1eHvRxtbmEiDTi3/L/xVth2ebh6QLC2/hWaQ3Wacyqb39axWidHU\n/fodV5tBl+z/O2+8NL41aDtcjL9VsYJF/AeZGsI/yK9GA0co4YCTaZmluacLFQCo\nSoXGcqRsXyxLLmgjrLFnSPt1mwHrrt/zfFRzUtOFJ