package.json version mismatch (^1.3.5 -> ^1.4.1)\n- Fix vite.config.ts minify setting to be mode-conditional (production only)\n- Remove hardcoded Descope version in host-app vite.config.ts, read from package.json\n- Fix RemoteComponentWrapper JSX formatting (button indentation)\n- Remove duplicate JSDoc comment blocks in ImagesPage.tsx\n- Fix StandaloneImagePage documentation (routerType default is ''memory'', not ''browser'')\n- Fix userDisplay test name to match actual behavior for empty strings\n\nDRY Improvements:\n- Extract extractTenantsFromUser helper function in TenantContext.tsx\n- Export ImageUploadPageProps type from federation barrel\n\nSecurity:\n- Restrict CORS allowed headers from \"*\" to specific headers needed\n- Add enable_localhost_cors variable for conditional localhost CORS (off in production)\n\nDocumentation:\n- Update useTenant hook JSDoc to clarify AuthProvider requirement\n- Add Notes column to ADR-001 review history table\n\nTest Coverage:\n- Add authTokenProvider unit tests for s3_service (7 tests)\n- Add authTokenProvider unit tests for host-app (6 tests)\n- Add AuthTokenBridge component tests for host-app (5 tests)\n\nTest Results:\n- s3_service: 63 tests passing\n- host-app: 33 tests passing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d0dba771d068886e3cde4bc31edcfcaa73761ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/8d0dba771d068886e3cde4bc31edcfcaa73761ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/462fca4e7824b2c665beb16c12ce1f1da10a7b0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/462fca4e7824b2c665beb16c12ce1f1da10a7b0a","node_id":"C_kwDOREbE-toAKDQ2MmZjYTRlNzgyNGIyYzY2NWJlYjE2YzEyY2UxZjFkYTEwYTdiMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/201938a5f33795b841c1ffe053b62f5359037637","sha":"201938a5f33795b841c1ffe053b62f5359037637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/201938a5f33795b841c1ffe053b62f5359037637"}],"sha":"462fca4e7824b2c665beb16c12ce1f1da10a7b0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/462fca4e7824b2c665beb16c12ce1f1da10a7b0a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/201938a5f33795b841c1ffe053b62f5359037637/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T21:53:38Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T21:53:38Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Add host-app micro-frontend with Module Federation and ADR compliance\n\nMajor Features:\n- Add host-app as a shell application that consumes s3_service via Module Federation\n- Implement consolidated navigation with user greeting and single logout button\n- Add hideChrome prop to federated component for seamless embedding\n- Implement Zustand store for tenant state management (ADR-005 compliance)\n- Add comprehensive test coverage for all new components\n\nHost App Features:\n- React/Vite functional components with TypeScript\n- Module Federation consumer configuration\n- AuthTokenBridge for cross-app auth synchronization\n- RemoteComponentWrapper with error boundary and suspense\n- Protected routes with Descope authentication\n\nS3 Service Module Federation:\n- StandaloneImagePage component exposed via federation\n- Router type options (browser/memory/none) for flexible embedding\n- hideChrome prop to hide header/footer when embedded\n- Federation exports for TenantProvider, useTenant, and Zustand store\n\nADR Compliance:\n- ADR-003: React/Vite functional components (100%)\n- ADR-004: Module Federation micro-frontend architecture (100%)\n- ADR-005: Zustand for global state with persist middleware (now compliant)\n- ADR-001: Documented non-applicability (entity IDs delegated to Descope)\n\nCode Quality Fixes:\n- Fixed curly braces in userDisplay.ts\n- Changed || to ?? for nullish coalescing\n- Fixed unsafe member access on error objects\n- Added proper type assertions in tests\n- Fixed import order with ESLint comments\n\nTerraform:\n- Add host_app_acm.tf for ACM certificate\n- Add host_app_service.tf for S3 bucket and CloudFront distribution\n- Update outputs and variables for host app deployment\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c4c462ddcac503c9a6e4550ea99d14992e2f5cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/6c4c462ddcac503c9a6e4550ea99d14992e2f5cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/201938a5f33795b841c1ffe053b62f5359037637","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/201938a5f33795b841c1ffe053b62f5359037637","node_id":"C_kwDOREbE-toAKDIwMTkzOGE1ZjMzNzk1Yjg0MWMxZmZlMDUzYjYyZjUzNTkwMzc2Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/912eb271585c7f157d0adc9b67df3671488a2446","sha":"912eb271585c7f