{"date":"2026-01-30T17:29:14Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Add returnUrl redirect support to IDP service\n\nWhen external services redirect to IDP for authentication, they can\npass a returnUrl parameter. After successful authentication, the user\nis redirected back to the calling service.\n\nIncludes URL validation to prevent open redirect vulnerabilities -\nonly allows redirects to trusted sb.fullbay.com subdomains and localhost.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"173a57c0552414578e0bce172f33f17789af4530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/173a57c0552414578e0bce172f33f17789af4530"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/1ded145961c784282f13ae7e8f636a939b2feca6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/1ded145961c784282f13ae7e8f636a939b2feca6","node_id":"C_kwDOREbE-toAKDFkZW