/api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/5927d5ba57df0c8e0b531d965fe22134ad6bd5c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T16:52:48Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T16:52:48Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Update SDLC plan to reflect S3 service implementation\n\nDocuments the completion of all three components for the S3 image upload\nservice: Lambda API, React frontend, and Terraform infrastructure.\n\nImplementation summary:\n- S3 Presigned URL API Lambda with TypeScript\n- React frontend with Descope authentication\n- Complete AWS infrastructure with Terraform\n\nAll components follow best practices for TypeScript, React, and Terraform\nas specified in the project guidelines.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04985ba9cb2302cd9629bf24b321f71a71c9fd03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/04985ba9cb2302cd9629bf24b321f71a71c9fd03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/5927d5ba57df0c8e0b531d965fe22134ad6bd5c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/5927d5ba57df0c8e0b531d965fe22134ad6bd5c0","node_id":"C_kwDOREbE-toAKDU5MjdkNWJhNTdkZjBjOGUwYjUzMWQ5NjVmZTIyMTM0YWQ2YmQ1YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/a92bc39c9b5418d3f037c50ab60e8fc718b9ca36","sha":"a92bc39c9b5418d3f037c50ab60e8fc718b9ca36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/a92bc39c9b5418d3f037c50ab60e8fc718b9ca36"}],"sha":"5927d5ba57df0c8e0b531d965fe22134ad6bd5c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/5927d5ba57df0c8e0b531d965fe22134ad6bd5c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/a92bc39c9b5418d3f037c50ab60e8fc718b9ca36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T16:52:38Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T16:52:38Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Add Terraform infrastructure for S3 image service\n\nImplements complete AWS infrastructure for S3 image upload service including\nS3, CloudFront, Lambda, API Gateway, and DNS configuration.\n\nResources:\n- S3 bucket for image storage with CORS and encryption\n- S3 bucket for frontend static hosting\n- CloudFront distributions with ACM certificates\n- Lambda functions for presigned URL generation\n- API Gateway REST API with CORS\n- Route53 DNS records (descope-s3.sb.fullbay.com)\n- IAM roles and policies\n- CloudWatch log groups\n\nS3 Image Bucket:\n- Versioning enabled\n- Lifecycle policies for cleanup\n- CORS for frontend and IDP domains\n- Server-side encryption (AES256)\n- Public access blocked\n\nCloudFront:\n- Custom domain with HTTPS\n- Origin Access Control for S3\n- Security headers policy\n- SPA routing support (404/403 to index.html)\n- Gzip compression\n\nLambda Functions:\n- Generate upload URL (POST /upload-url)\n- Generate download URL (GET /download-url)\n- Node.js 20 runtime\n- 512MB memory, 30s timeout\n- Environment variables for bucket name\n\nAPI Gateway:\n- REST API with v1 stage\n- Lambda proxy integration\n- CORS enabled for all endpoints\n- CloudWatch logging\n\nSecurity:\n- ACM certificates in us-east-1 for CloudFront\n- DNS validation for certificates\n- Least-privilege IAM policies\n- Encrypted S3 buckets\n- HTTPS only\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb7571267d019507baf4b1b0f90b5b1df0227d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/eb7571267d019507baf4b1b0f90b5b1df0227d90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/a92bc39c9b5418d3f037c50ab60e8fc718b9ca36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/a92bc39c9b5418d3f037c50ab60e8fc718b9ca36","node_id":"C_kwDOREbE-toAKGE5MmJjMzljOWI1NDE4ZDNmMDM3YzUwYWI2MGU4ZmM3MThiOWNhMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/d303bd0eb837d1161c54d06b3146bb64a7212641","sha":"d303bd0eb837d1161c54d06b3146bb64a7212641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/d303bd0eb837d1161c54d06b3146bb64a7212641"}],"sha":"a92bc39c9b5418d3f037c50ab60e8fc718b9ca36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/a92bc39c9b5418d3f037c50ab60e8fc718b9ca36"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/d303bd0eb837d1161c54d06b3146bb64a7212641/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T16:52:23Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T16:52:23Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Add S3 Service Frontend for image upload with Descope auth\n\nImplements React-based image upload application with Descope authentication\nand ReBaC authorization.\n\nFeatures:\n- Descope authentication with redirect to IDP service\n- Protected routes requiring authentication\n- Image upload with drag-and-drop support\n- Image gallery displaying user accessible images\n- Direct S3 upload using presigned URLs\n- ReBaC integration via AppSync for access control\n- Responsive design with Tailwind CSS\n- TypeScript with strict type checking\n\nComponents:\n- ImageUploader: Drag-and-drop file upload with validation\n- ImageGallery: Grid display of user images\n- ProtectedRoute: Authentication guard for routes\n- useDescope: Custom hook for auth state\n\nServices:\n- ImageService: Handles upload/download flow\n- AppSyncClient: GraphQL client for ReBaC relations\n\nIntegration:\n- Redirects to descope-idp.sb.fullbay.com for login\n- Creates ReBaC relations (namespace: metadata_item, relation: owner)\n- Queries AppSync for user accessible images\n- Uses presigned URLs for direct S3 upload/download\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree