ived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/d88b72e0b55e30b89c94d0ca37f804be9f419c5d","node_id":"C_kwDOREbE-toAKGQ4OGI3MmUwYjU1ZTMwYjg5Yzk0ZDBjYTM3ZjgwNGJlOWY0MTljNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/19bdf5e6ce5690b1379369c9c5cbf5aca2496708","sha":"19bdf5e6ce5690b1379369c9c5cbf5aca2496708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/19bdf5e6ce5690b1379369c9c5cbf5aca2496708"}],"sha":"d88b72e0b55e30b89c94d0ca37f804be9f419c5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/d88b72e0b55e30b89c94d0ca37f804be9f419c5d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/19bdf5e6ce5690b1379369c9c5cbf5aca2496708/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T15:49:54Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T15:49:54Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Add Terraform infrastructure for IDP Service deployment\n\nImplement AWS infrastructure for hosting the Descope IDP Service as a\nstatic website with global CDN distribution.\n\nInfrastructure Components:\n- S3 bucket for static website hosting with versioning\n- CloudFront distribution with custom domain and HTTPS\n- ACM certificate in us-east-1 for CloudFront (DNS validated)\n- Route53 A and AAAA records for descope-idp.sb.fullbay.com\n- Origin Access Control (OAC) for secure S3 access\n- Response headers policy for security (HSTS, X-Frame-Options, CSP, etc.)\n- Lifecycle policies for S3 version management\n\nFeatures:\n- HTTPS-only access with TLS 1.2+\n- SPA routing support (404/403 → index.html)\n- IPv6 support\n- Automated DNS validation for SSL certificate\n- CloudWatch logging for distribution access\n- Security headers enforcement\n- Cache optimization with manual chunks\n\nConfiguration:\n- Route53 zone lookup by domain name (sb.fullbay.com)\n- Environment: sandbox\n- Region: us-west-2 (main), us-east-1 (ACM)\n- Domain: descope-idp.sb.fullbay.com\n\nIncludes comprehensive deployment guide in IDP_DEPLOYMENT.md with\nstep-by-step instructions for building, deploying, and updating the\napplication.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"654886abe634327a9da85d85efc846417f46798c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/654886abe634327a9da85d85efc846417f46798c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/19bdf5e6ce5690b1379369c9c5cbf5aca2496708","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1