//api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/61eee979bb935ea4401b964699da6abcc0fcec5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T15:49:42Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T15:49:42Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Add Descope IDP Service React application\n\nImplement TypeScript and React-based Single Page Application (SPA) for\nsecure authentication via Descope. The application provides:\n\n- Landing page with Descope authentication integration\n- User profile display with comprehensive information\n- Tenant switching support (via Descope SDK)\n- Responsive mobile-first design with Tailwind CSS\n- Full TypeScript strict mode compliance\n- Comprehensive test coverage with Vitest\n- Security headers and CSP configuration\n\nTechnical Stack:\n- React 18 (functional components only)\n- TypeScript with strict mode enabled\n- Vite for fast builds and development\n- Descope React SDK v2.26.0\n- Tailwind CSS for styling\n- React Router v6 for routing\n\nFeatures:\n- Descope hosted authentication page redirect\n- User profile with email, name, tenant info, and custom attributes\n- Loading states and error boundaries\n- Logout with session clear\n- Environment variable configuration\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae638e81f9f3cd88b2f45599a13a539ebd1c899b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/ae638e81f9f3cd88b2f45599a13a539ebd1c899