gure OpenAPI metadata in application.properties\n- Add OpenAPI annotations to TenantResource endpoints\n- Add schema annotations to model classes (Tenant, TenantRequest, PaginatedResponse)\n- Generate OpenAPI spec in openapi/ directory (YAML and JSON formats)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"864ef87121e5ad12d91daf0a288724eaeed82353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/864ef87121e5ad12d91daf0a288724eaeed82353"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/fb819e678a63395d518c0ae6fef249e9a64470e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/fb819e678a63395d518c0ae6fef249e9a64470e9","node_id":"C_kwDOREbE-toAKGZiODE5ZTY3OGE2MzM5NWQ1MThjMGFlNmZlZjI0OWU5YTY0NDcwZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/a463205038a0147bbab189004f8b0979e7af0df5","sha":"a463205038a0147bbab189004f8b0979e7af0df5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/a463205038a0147bbab189004f8b0979e7af0df5"}],"sha":"fb819e678a63395d518c0ae6fef249e9a64470e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/fb819e678a63395d518c0ae6fef249e9a64470e9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/a463205038a0147bbab189004f8b0979e7af0df5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T00:14:12Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T00:14:12Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Add member_service and rebac_service Lambda functions with Terraform\n\nThis commit adds two new Quarkus-based Java 21 Lambda services:\n\n**Member Service** (`member_service/`)\n- CRUD operations for Descope tenant members\n- REST endpoints: POST/GET/PUT/DELETE on /tenants/{tenantId}/members\n- Descope Java SDK integration for user management\n- Preserves tenant associations during member updates\n\n**ReBAC Service** (`rebac_service/`)\n- CRUD operations for Descope FGA (Fine-Grained Authorization)\n- REST endpoints for relation tuple management:\n  - POST/DELETE /relations - Create/delete relation tuples\n  - GET /relations/resource/{id} - Get relations for a resource\n  - GET /relations/target/{id} - Get resources a target can access\n  - GET /relations/who-can-access - Query who can access a resource\n- Works with metadata_item namespace schema\n\n**Terraform Infrastructure**\n- member_service.tf: Lambda, security group, target group, ALB rule (priority 240)\n- rebac_service.tf: Lambda, security group, target group, ALB rule (priority 230)\n- Both services deployed with SnapStart enabled\n- Multi-value headers enabled for proper query parameter handling\n\n**Org Service Updates**\n- Code formatting and style improvements\n- Updated tests for better Descope SDK mocking\n\nAll services are deployed and tested against the existing ALB at:\nhttps://external-private-alb-984336828.us-west-2.elb.amazonaws.com\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"181ad9893969804d1b944e3541cec8c6d07f5b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/181ad9893969804d1b944e3541cec8c6d07f5b3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/a463205038a0147bbab189004f8b0979e7af0df5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/a463205038a0147bbab189004f8b0979e7af0df5","node_id":"C_kwDOREbE-toAKGE0NjMyMDUwMzhhMDE0N2JiYWIxODkwMDRmOGIwOTc5ZTdhZjBkZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/4dc5bf89ca39d93bdc904e0dd3d5fae7fb95b3b8","sha":"4dc5bf89ca39d93bdc904e0dd3d5fae7fb95b3b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/4dc5bf89ca39d93bdc904e0dd3d5fae7fb95b3b8"}],"sha":"a463205038a0147bbab189004f8b0979e7af0df5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/a463205038a0147bbab189004f8b0979e7af0df5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/4dc5bf89ca39d93bdc904e0dd3d5fae7fb95b3b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-29T22:04:21Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T22:04:21Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Add Terraform infrastructure for Lambda deployment with ALB integration\n\nThis commit adds complete Terraform infrastructure as code for deploying\nthe tenant management Lambda service to AWS. The infrastructure includes\nLambda configuration, ALB integration, IAM roles, and CloudWatch logging.\n\nInfrastructure components:\n- Lambda function with Java 21 runtime and SnapStart enabled\n- VPC integration in private subnets for security\n- ALB target group and listener rule for /tenants* path routing\n- IAM roles and policies with least privilege access\n- Secrets Manager integration for Descope credentials\n- CloudWatch log group with 7-day retention\n- Security groups for network isolation\n\nConfiguration features:\n- Configurable variables with sensible defaults\n- Data sources for existing AWS resources (VPC, ALB, Secrets)\n- Modular file organization for maintainability\n- Comprehensive outputs for integration\n- Validated Terraform configuration\n\nDefault configuration:\n- VPC: vpc-03163f35ccd0fc6a9\n- Region: us-west-2\n- Environment: sandbox\n- ALB: external-private-alb\n- Secret: sandbox/descope/rebac\n- Lambda: 1024MB memory, 60s timeout\n\nDocumentation:\n- Comprehensive README with usage instructions\n- Variable documentation with types and defaults\n- Architecture overview and design decisions\n- Troubleshooting guide and maintenance procedures\n- Security considerations and best practices\n\nAlso includes:\n- SDLC plan document tracking implementation progress\n- Implementation summary with complete project overview\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"807ad918fa8e15b8009b7f1fdbc424444fec8f10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/807ad918fa8e15b8009b7f1fdbc424444fec8f10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/4dc5bf89ca39d93bdc904e0dd3d5fae7fb95b3b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/4dc5bf89ca39d93bdc904e0dd3d5fae7fb95b3b8","node_id":"C_kwDOREbE-toAKDRkYzViZjg5Y2EzOWQ5M2JkYzkwNGUwZGQzZDVmYWU3ZmI5NWIzYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commit/25a47847c8b3fba4873ceac918bd0b802aa99287","sha":"25a47847c8b3fba4873ceac918bd0b802aa99287","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/25a47847c8b3fba4873ceac918bd0b802aa99287"}],"sha":"4dc5bf89ca39d93bdc904e0dd3d5fae7fb95b3b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/4dc5bf89ca39d93bdc904e0dd3d5fae7fb95b3b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/commits/25a47847c8b3fba4873ceac918bd0b802aa99287/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-29T22:03:55Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T22:03:55Z","email":"steve.rhoton@fullbay.com","name":"Steve Rhoton"},"message":"Add Quarkus-based tenant management Lambda service with Descope SDK integration\n\nThis commit adds a complete Java 21/Quarkus REST API service for managing\nDescope tenants. The service provides full CRUD operations with pagination\nsupport and is designed to run as an AWS Lambda function.\n\nKey features:\n- REST endpoints for Create, Read, Update, Delete operations on tenants\n- Paginated tenant listing with configurable page size\n- Integration with Descope Java SDK (v1.0.60)\n- JSON structured logging for CloudWatch\n- Comprehensive error handling with appropriate HTTP status codes\n- Environment-based configuration for Descope credentials\n\nTechnical stack:\n- Java 21\n- Quarkus 3.16.3\n- Gradle build system with Gradle wrapper\n- Descope Java SDK for tenant management\n- JUnit 5 and AssertJ for testing\n- Spotless for code formatting (Google Java Format)\n\nCode organization:\n- REST controller (TenantResource) with JAX-RS annotations\n- Service layer (TenantService) with Descope SDK integration\n- Configuration layer (DescopeConfig) for client initialization\n- Model classes for request/response DTOs\n- Comprehensive unit and integration test suite\n\nBuild and configuration:\n- Gradle build with Quarkus plugins\n- Application properties for runtime configuration\n- Test configuration for local development\n- README with API documentation and usage examples\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3725672a69c85e00ac80d10d381f888952c7eb09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/trees/3725672a69c85e00ac80d10d381f888952c7eb09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/srhoton/descope-rebac-app/git/commits/25a47847c8b3fba4873ceac918bd0b802aa99287","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1685782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/srhoton","id":1685782,"login":"srhoton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU3ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srhoton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sr