https://api.github.com/repos/igumanof22/date-calculator/commits/0ee5eff6c851473af52605e36392eb9fc2f6bbea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-09T04:27:01Z","email":"ikhsangumanof@gmail.com","name":"M. Ikhsan Gumanof"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-09T04:27:01Z","email":"ikhsangumanof@gmail.com","name":"M. Ikhsan Gumanof"},"message":"Updates date calculator to version 4.0.4\n\nIncrements the addon version to 4.0.4.\n\nImproves the \"jamMulai\" (start time) options generation. It now considers the current time when the selected date is today, offering time slots starting from the next 30-minute interval.\n\nResets the selected \"jamMulai\" if the date is changed and the previously selected time is no longer in the updated options.\n\nAdds webpack ignore plugin to prevent moment locales from being bundled, reducing bundle size.","tree":{"sha":"a44871a8f9a563f31e7d941bbebd29e061abbaed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/igumanof22/date-calculator/git/trees/a44871a8f9a563f31e7d941bbebd29e061abbaed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/igumanof22/date-calculator/git/commits/0ee5eff6c851473af52605e36392eb9fc2f6bbea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61772074?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igumanof22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igumanof22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igumanof22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igumanof22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/igumanof22","id":61772074,"login":"igumanof22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzcyMDc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igumanof22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igumanof22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igumanof22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":