://api.github.com/repos/kalen1o/modern-newtab/commits/1b4ac14f9ae8d4f995eab76b2ba44e7c650034c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T02:11:00Z","email":"ngungonngon@gmail.com","name":"Quang Tran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T02:11:00Z","email":"ngungonngon@gmail.com","name":"Quang Tran"},"message":"Enhance user authentication and search history management in newtab-service\n\n- Updated AuthResponse to include userType for better user identification.\n- Refactored AuthService to generate tokens with userType and adjusted methods to handle userType in token management.\n- Modified SearchHistoryController to restrict access to registered users only, ensuring guest users cannot save or access search history.\n- Updated SearchHistoryRequest to use userEmail instead of userId for better clarity and consistency.\n- Enhanced SearchHistoryService to manage search history based on userEmail.\n- Added new UserPrincipal class to encapsulate user details and simplify authentication handling.\n- Integrated lucide-react for improved UI components in the frontend.\n- Updated AutocompleteInput to conditionally load and save search history based on user registration status.\n- Added sample news articles and migration scripts for new database fields related to news articles.","tree":{"sha":"3d3567b4aa77dc4ccf400eb846350f76e25511f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kalen1o/modern-newtab/git/trees/3d3567b4aa77dc4ccf400eb846350f76e25511f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kalen1o/modern-newtab/git/commits/1b4ac14f9ae8d4f995eab76b2ba44e7c650034c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44780389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalen1o/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalen1o/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kalen1o/following{/other_user}","gists_url