\nCoders (implement against designs):\n- backend_coder.md → Python, APIs, server implementation\n- ui_coder.md → Vite, React, frontend implementation\n\nValidator:\n- tester.md → Updated as final quality gate with checklists and PASS/FAIL verdict\n\nRemoved:\n- coder.md → Replaced by backend_coder.md and ui_coder.md\n- dessigner.md → Replaced by designer.md (fixed typo)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ca7ce5404df81b241a0f3462353fc3d5a0952e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leirv/adw-worklows-multi-repo/git/trees/5ca7ce5404df81b241a0f3462353fc3d5a0952e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leirv/adw-worklows-multi-repo/git/commits/e05f3aac686663a63c06b8b35042578ac89bf9c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181590746?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leirv","id":181590746,"login":"leirv","node_id":"U_kgDOCtLa2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leirv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leirv/adw-worklows-multi-repo/commit/e05f3aac686663a63c06b8b35042578ac89bf9c5","node_id":"C_kwDORFQMQtoAKGUwNWYzYWFjNjg2NjYzYTYzYzA2YjhiMzUwNDI1NzhhYzg5YmY5YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leirv/adw-worklows-multi-r